p7I06PartClosed is true. In production, check_evidence refuses the fixture's implementationId and distribution name (E35, E36, E60), and the evidence implementationId must equal its W02a profile's (E62). The remaining parts are explicitly carried to W02a-F: the W02a side of P7(a) (also W03), P7(b), P7(c) and the netpol identity mismatch. The refusal is identity-based, so renamed fixture components pass (N1). The carry chain should also be recorded in the W02g status record (N3).

